        {
            "id": "7504702",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "750470201",
                    "speaker": "Ur",
                    "text": "Grainfruit is so delicious... But if you eat them and only them, they stop tasting good after a few days."
                },
                {
                    "id": "750470202",
                    "speaker": "Ur",
                    "text": "Is that why humans... eat grass and Grainfruit at the same time...?"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7504703",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "750470301",
                    "speaker": "Huruk",
                    "text": "So sleepy. I want to sleep... But we have to stand here together..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "750470302",
                    "speaker": "Huruk",
                    "text": "Why... Do humans want to stand here all day?"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7504704",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "750470401",
                    "speaker": "Kusi",
                    "text": "Well, that's my weight under control, but... Hmm? What's up?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "750470402",
                            "text": "Might I ask your name?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "750470403",
                                    "speaker": "Kusi",
                                    "text": "Ah, right. I'm one of the sentries stationed here, although I'm in vacation mode right now..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "750470404",
                                    "speaker": "Kusi",
                                    "text": "So if something's come up, go look for the fella beside me, Yukom!"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "750470405",
                            "text": "Something on your mind?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "750470406",
                                    "speaker": "Kusi",
                                    "text": "Well, y'see, I've been getting a little heavier lately, so I've added lots of healthy veggies to my usual Grainfruit diet."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "750470407",
                                    "speaker": "Kusi",
                                    "text": "But for some reason, my buddy Ur's been copying me by eating a whole bunch of grass... Not a disaster, since Saurians are omnivores, but I worry he can keep up with all his nutritional needs, eating all that grass..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "750470408",
                                    "speaker": "Kusi",
                                    "text": "Guess I need to give him a bit of a talking-to later."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "750470409",
                            "text": "Nothing, really.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "750470410",
                                    "speaker": "Kusi",
                                    "text": "Sure. Safe travels, then, outlander."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
